# Copy this to /home/ubuntu/community-edition/.env  (note the dot in the name).
# If a .env already exists there, append this line to it instead.
#
# COMPOSE_FILE makes every plain `docker compose ...` command (including the
# ones inside update.sh) operate on all three files, with no -f flags needed
# anywhere. ORDER MATTERS: later files win, so the override must come LAST or
# the upstream caddy-gen command (example.com) beats the override's.
COMPOSE_FILE=docker-compose.yml:reverse-proxy/docker-compose.caddy-gen.yml:docker-compose.override.yml
